      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "asdfasdfasdf****",
      "help_en": "The ID of the item to play first. When the carousel starts, this item is played.\n\n<notice>\n\nThis parameter is required only when you set ResumeMode to Custom.\n\n</notice>",
      "help_zh": "起始节目单项ID。启动轮播时将先播放此节目单项。\n<notice> 如果ResumeMode参数设置为Custom时，此参数才必传。\n</notice>",
